---

<footer class="w-full bg-surface-container-low mt-space-4xl pt-space-3xl pb-space-2xl" id="contacto">
  <div class="max-w-max-width-content mx-auto px-gutter-mobile lg:px-gutter-desktop">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-space-xl pb-space-2xl">
      <!-- Info y Marca -->
      <div class="md:col-span-5 flex flex-col gap-space-md">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-space-sm">
          <img
            alt="Logo Profesora Clara"
            class="h-8 w-auto object-contain"
            src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuA-EUDuP_duy4XZe-eSJg9Ea9TaOJT9RHrsj-vaFKklxWcYPC9sqke3MwKRwL3qFXWQwLpQAdK_2U6mVXPrIxxAf1qDAKLbnBicR2pg9w8Vd1tRKf9OyqYbq2y9Jm4umFM05lRPB_AWVos9h91_swlkA7pYf-loRvjx6ihwyKprERVDVl59OMtYVoWH0kvxFmwvJU8IoMOVVvUyXOjVbt2aI02OlEK4SF85v_jpd3R5pykbe3ixDD0XIQ"
          />
          <span class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">Clara Méndez</span>
        </div>

        <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant max-w-max-width-text">
          Acompañamiento pedagógico personalizado, mentoría académica y refuerzo escolar enfocado en la confianza, el rigor intelectual y el amor por aprender.
        </p>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-space-sm pt-space-xs">
          <a
            aria-label="WhatsApp"
            class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-surface-container-lowest flex items-center justify-center text-secondary hover:bg-secondary-container hover:text-on-secondary-container transition-colors shadow-[0_2px_8px_rgba(36,33,30,0.04)]"
            href="https://wa.me/?text=Hola%20Clara,%20quisiera%20hacerte%20una%20consulta"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">chat</span>
          </a>
          <a
            aria-label="Instagram"
            class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-surface-container-lowest flex items-center justify-center text-secondary hover:bg-secondary-container hover:text-on-secondary-container transition-colors shadow-[0_2px_8px_rgba(36,33,30,0.04)]"
            href="#"
          >
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">photo_camera</span>
          </a>
          <a
            aria-label="LinkedIn"
            class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-surface-container-lowest flex items-center justify-center text-secondary hover:bg-secondary-container hover:text-on-secondary-container transition-colors shadow-[0_2px_8px_rgba(36,33,30,0.04)]"
            href="#"
          >
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">school</span>
          </a>
          <a
            aria-label="Correo electrónico"
            class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-surface-container-lowest flex items-center justify-center text-secondary hover:bg-secondary-container hover:text-on-secondary-container transition-colors shadow-[0_2px_8px_rgba(36,33,30,0.04)]"
            href="mailto:hola@claramendez.es"
          >
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">mail</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Enlaces rápidos -->
      <div class="md:col-span-3 md:col-start-7 flex flex-col gap-space-sm">
        <span class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface mb-space-2xs">Enlaces rápidos</span>
        <nav class="flex flex-col gap-space-xs">
          <a class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface transition-colors" href="#sobre-mi">
            Sobre mí
          </a>
          <a class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface transition-colors" href="#servicios">
            Servicios de tutoría
          </a>
          <a class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface transition-colors" href="#testimonios">
            Opiniones y familias
          </a>
          <a class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface transition-colors" href="#galeria">
            Espacio pedagógico
          </a>
          <a class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface transition-colors" href="#contacto">
            Contacto directo
          </a>
        </nav>
      </div>

      <!-- Contacto y espacio -->
      <div class="md:col-span-3 flex flex-col gap-space-sm">
        <span class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface mb-space-2xs">Contacto y espacio</span>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-space-xs font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
          <p class="flex items-center gap-space-xs">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-primary">location_on</span>
            Madrid &amp; Sesiones Online
          </p>
          <p class="flex items-center gap-space-xs">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-primary">mail</span>
            hola@claramendez.es
          </p>
          <p class="flex items-center gap-space-xs">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-primary">schedule</span>
            Lun - Vie: 9:00 - 20:00
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-space-xs">
          <a
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-space-md py-space-xs rounded-full bg-secondary-fixed text-on-secondary-fixed font-label-md text-label-md hover:bg-secondary hover:text-on-secondary transition-all"
            href="https://wa.me/?text=Hola%20Clara,%20quisiera%20agendar%20una%20consulta%20inicial%20gratuita"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            Consulta inicial gratuita
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Copyright -->
    <div class="pt-space-xl border-t border-surface-container-high/60 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-space-md text-center sm:text-left">
      <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">
        © 2024 Clara Méndez. Educación con calidez, paciencia y rigor.
      </p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-space-lg">
        <a class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface transition-colors" href="#">
          Aviso legal
        </a>
        <a class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface transition-colors" href="#">
          Política de privacidad
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

